  alias: THE ONES WHO KNOW
  species: Threl
  issuingFactionId: guild
  charges: Theft of guild property.
  whoTheyActuallyAre: "He stole a beacon. He has spent two years taking it apart.
    He has diagrams. The diagrams are correct \u2014 he has worked out the vector
    and it goes up and it does not come down, and nobody would look at them. Approach:
    The diagrams are all over the walls. The player walks past the answer to the
    entire game in Act 2 and cannot read it yet.\n\nWhen beaten: \"It's not a transport.
    It was never a transport. It's a delivery.\""
